# Workspace hygiene

Do not create documentation, archives, chat exports, or novel content inside `.cursor/`.

Use these locations instead:

- `docs/project/` — active project reference docs
- `docs/archive/` — historical notes and setup guide copies
- `Session_Summaries/` — session summaries
- `yy_Archive/` — cold storage and old desktop dumps
- `Story_Bible/`, `Draft_1/`, `Active_Draft_2/` — novel content
